Could reachable be unknown because we don't know axios internals? But code clearly lacks config object. The prompt says reachable = actual calls vulnerable function and passed data may come from external. It calls axios.get with external data. But trigger condition specific: only when config object with __proto__ passed. Since no config object, no. So no.

